<title>JAPAN: Fujitsu says develops blue-laser diode technology.</title>
<headline>Fujitsu says develops blue-laser diode technology.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fujitsu Ltd said on Thursday that a subsidiary, Fujitsu Laboratories Ltd, has developed a technology suitable for mass producing blue-laser diodes.</p>
<p>The new technology will make possible the production of blue lasers in a manner similar to conventional red lasers, a Fujitsu spokesman said.</p>
<p>The technology will pave the way for commercialisation of blue lasers by 2000, the statement said.</p>
</text>
